    "Which value of x satisfies 2x + 9 > 5x - 6?::x = 6|x = 5|x = 4|x = 7": "Subtract 2x and add 6 to both sides: 15 is greater than 3x. Divide by 3, and x is less than 5 — the only choice below 5 is x equals 4.",
