    "What is the equation, in slope-intercept form, of a line with slope -3 that passes through (0, 8)?::y = -3x + 8|y = 3x + 8|y = -3x - 8|y = 8x - 3": "Slope negative 3 and y-intercept 8 slot directly into y equals m x plus b, giving y equals negative 3x plus 8.",
