    "Solve for x: (4x + 1)/3 = 7::x = 5|x = 4|x = 20|x = 6": "Multiply both sides by 3: 4x plus 1 equals 21. Subtract 1 to get 4x equals 20, then divide by 4 — x equals 5.",
    "Solve for x: 7x - 12 = 30::x = 6|x = 42|x = 3|x = 18/7": "Add 12 to both sides: 7x equals 42. Divide by 7, and x equals 6.",
