    "Which value of x satisfies 5x + 7 ≥ 2x + 22?::x = 5|x = 4|x = 3|x = 6": "Subtract 2x and 7 from both sides: 3x is greater than or equal to 15. Divide by 3, and x is greater than or equal to 5 — exactly matching x equals 5.",
