    "A line passes through (1, 4) and (6, 29). What is its slope?::5|1/5|33/5|-5": "The y-values climb from 4 to 29, a rise of 25. The x-values run from 1 to 6, a run of 5. 25 divided by 5 gives a slope of 5.",
