    "Simplify: (y^2)^7::y^14|y^9|y^128|7y^2": "When you raise a power to another power, you multiply the exponents — 2 times 7 is 14, so the answer is y to the 14th power.",
    "Simplify: (x^4)^6::x^24|x^10|x^4096|6x^4": "When you raise a power to another power, you multiply the exponents — 4 times 6 is 24, so the answer is x to the 24th power.",
