    "A runner's total distance starts at 175 and grows by 24 each week. What is the distance after 16 weeks?::560|558|-559|559": "Start from the initial value, 175, and add the rate times the number of periods: 175 plus 24 times 16, which is 175 plus 384, giving 559.",
    "A vineyard's grape yield starts at 81 and grows by 29 each season. What is the yield after 19 seasons?::631|633|-632|632": "Start from the initial value, 81, and add the rate times the number of periods: 81 plus 29 times 19, which is 81 plus 551, giving 632.",
