    "A line with a slope of -6 passes through the point (-6, 37). What is the line's y-intercept?::0|-1|1|2": "Plug the point into y equals mx plus b: 37 equals negative 6 times negative 6, plus b. That's negative 6 times negative 6, which is 36, so b is 37 minus 36, or 1.",
    "A line with a slope of -7 passes through the point (10, -1). What is the line's y-intercept?::-69|69|68|70": "Plug the point into y equals mx plus b: negative 1 equals negative 7 times 10, plus b. That's negative 7 times 10, which is negative 70, so b is negative 1 minus negative 70, or 69.",
    "A library's book collection starts at 14 and grows by 7 each month. What is the collection size after 14 months?::-112|112|113|111": "Start from the initial value, 14, and add the rate times the number of periods: 14 plus 7 times 14, which is 14 plus 98, giving 112.",
    "A charity's donation total starts at 187 and grows by 10 each month. What is the donation total after 13 months?::-317|316|317|318": "Start from the initial value, 187, and add the rate times the number of periods: 187 plus 10 times 13, which is 187 plus 130, giving 317.",
