    "The function g is defined by g(x) = 5x + 8. For what value of x does g(x) = -42?": "Set the function equal to negative 42 and solve: negative 42 equals 5x, plus 8. Subtract 8 from both sides: 5x equals negative 50. Divide by 5, and x is negative 10.",
