    "What is the x-intercept of the line y = -x - 2?::(-2, 0)|(2, 0)|(0, -2)|(0, 0)": "Set y to 0: 0 equals negative x, minus 2. Move the 2 to the other side: negative x equals 2, so x is negative 2.",
